unners", "keywords": ["spot", "runners"], "long_description": "Welcome to Spot Runners! A Gorilla Tag Inspired game that uses your hands to move.\n\nShop (Mall) \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f\n- Buy Cosmetics with Spotty Coins!\n- Check out Sales and Limited-Time Bundles & Packs!\n- Make a Unique Style to show off to Friends!\n\nGames \ud83c\udfae\n- Zero Gravity | Float around in Space!\n- Spot Battles | Fight other Spots with swords while avoiding lava!\n- Nextbots | Get chased around by memes!\n- Colour Game | Stand on the right colour tile before it gets too late!\n\nNews \ud83d\udcf0\n- Get regular updates from Blessed Analytics!\n- Stay up-to-date to what's happening!\n\nThere is so many more stuff to explore in this game. What are you wating for?", "short_description": "Become a Spot"}]}, "developer_name": "Blessed Analytics", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1h-TiPEj091YizguawIzMY2qS-U_sFa4k5o59AMJUUOQ/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BLESS!", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spot-runners-meta/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26959818750377194"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1669933830808409"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1669933830808409"}, "is_approved": true, "fir